{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Puffin Parcel Post,</i></strong> your goal is to manage a growing postal network in a charming world where friendly puffins are your dedicated delivery crew. Each day brings a growing number of parcels to deliver, and it's up to you to <strong>place buildings strategically</strong> to keep up with demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/2968259bf36495693fa42891cff524e5.poster.avif?t=1765395604\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/2968259bf36495693fa42891cff524e5.webm?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/2968259bf36495693fa42891cff524e5.mp4?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your network expands, you'll need to make smart choices about where to position post offices and other key structures to ensure efficient deliveries. With <strong>multiple levels and environments,</strong> you'll have plenty of optimization challenges to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/d1a7c8bcd6c3b8fe8d455da68d6c450f.poster.avif?t=1765395604\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/d1a7c8bcd6c3b8fe8d455da68d6c450f.webm?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/d1a7c8bcd6c3b8fe8d455da68d6c450f.mp4?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress further, you'll need to balance growth with efficiency, making the best use of your resources to keep your puffin-powered postal service running smoothly. To help you adapt, you can unlock a variety of <strong>unique perks and upgrades</strong> that introduce fresh twists to your strategy. Some might help your puffins work faster, while others could allow you to process parcels more efficiently or uncover new building synergies. Each run offers a chance to explore a new combination of upgrades, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/c1f5c070eeeb64cb8b013bb4f38f5683.poster.avif?t=1765395604\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/c1f5c070eeeb64cb8b013bb4f38f5683.webm?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/c1f5c070eeeb64cb8b013bb4f38f5683.mp4?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its engaging gameplay set within a playful world, <i>Puffin Parcel Post</i> offers a roguelite experience full of discovery and replayability.  Can you build a postal network that keeps up with the ever-growing demand, or will your puffins get overwhelmed by the flood of parcels?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573440?t=1765395604","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573440?t=1765395604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/9d92ab7e6105f712edeaad7f092bff28788df584/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765395604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/9d92ab7e6105f712edeaad7f092bff28788df584/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765395604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3576730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Puffin Parcel Post,</i></strong> your goal is to manage a growing postal network in a charming world where friendly puffins are your dedicated delivery crew. Each day brings a growing number of parcels to deliver, and it's up to you to <strong>place buildings strategically</strong> to keep up with demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/2968259bf36495693fa42891cff524e5.poster.avif?t=1765395604\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/2968259bf36495693fa42891cff524e5.webm?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/2968259bf36495693fa42891cff524e5.mp4?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your network expands, you'll need to make smart choices about where to position post offices and other key structures to ensure efficient deliveries. With <strong>multiple levels and environments,</strong> you'll have plenty of optimization challenges to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/d1a7c8bcd6c3b8fe8d455da68d6c450f.poster.avif?t=1765395604\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/d1a7c8bcd6c3b8fe8d455da68d6c450f.webm?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/d1a7c8bcd6c3b8fe8d455da68d6c450f.mp4?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress further, you'll need to balance growth with efficiency, making the best use of your resources to keep your puffin-powered postal service running smoothly. To help you adapt, you can unlock a variety of <strong>unique perks and upgrades</strong> that introduce fresh twists to your strategy. Some might help your puffins work faster, while others could allow you to process parcels more efficiently or uncover new building synergies. Each run offers a chance to explore a new combination of upgrades, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/c1f5c070eeeb64cb8b013bb4f38f5683.poster.avif?t=1765395604\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/c1f5c070eeeb64cb8b013bb4f38f5683.webm?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/extras/c1f5c070eeeb64cb8b013bb4f38f5683.mp4?t=1765395604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its engaging gameplay set within a playful world, <i>Puffin Parcel Post</i> offers a roguelite experience full of discovery and replayability.  Can you build a postal network that keeps up with the ever-growing demand, or will your puffins get overwhelmed by the flood of parcels?</p>","developers":["AhoyByte, s.r.o."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573440/a983e29f40be63b356811186a1d87c8f10a8bfef/header.jpg?t=1765395604","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 (Intel) or ARM CPU (Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics with Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573440/794157374/3c67ac8b623ec14433cd194c87cbc13e1d16b216/1750469262/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749840890","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573440/794157374/3c67ac8b623ec14433cd194c87cbc13e1d16b216/1750469262/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749840890","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573440/794157374/3c67ac8b623ec14433cd194c87cbc13e1d16b216/1750469262/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749840890","id":257156438,"name":"Puffin Parcel Post Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156438/c4ab96975b5f12cd54b6f331e9f13aa8827e6841/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749840890"}],"name":"Puffin Parcel Post","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bi